bearing. DEXA scan at baseline and every 2 years.\n5. **Vocational rehabilitation**: If work duties become unsustainable, refer to vocational rehabilitation services for job modification, retraining, or disability evaluation.\n6. **Fall risk reassessment**: Annual fall screening with TUG test and fall diary.\n7. **Mental health monitoring**: Ongoing screening for depression and adjustment disorder given the psychological burden of progressive disability after decades of stability.',
